TASK B03
	TITLE "brigade init: the operational corpus repository, its schema and config.toml"
	STATUS todo
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "corpus"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "brigade init creates $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/brigade/, ~/.config/brigade/ by default, as a git"
		+ "repository holding _schema.awawa installed from the shipped template and a .gitignore"
		+ "listing config.toml, both committed in one commit with the user's git identity"
	SPEC "awawa lint --strict exits 0 on the created corpus"
	SPEC "the schema template lives at brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl and schema/ is gone"
		+ "from the repository root; init run from the clone and from dist/brigade.pyz installs the"
		+ "same file"
	SPEC "init writes config.toml once from a shipped string.Template, every key commented out with"
		+ "its meaning; tomllib reads it as an empty table"
	SPEC "brigade/system/paths builds the config, state and cache roots from XDG_CONFIG_HOME,"
		+ "XDG_STATE_HOME and XDG_CACHE_HOME with their defaults; the tests redirect brigade with"
		+ "these variables alone"
	SPEC "init creates neither $XDG_STATE_HOME/brigade/ nor $XDG_CACHE_HOME/brigade/"
	SPEC "a second init rewrites nothing and commits nothing; a present file that differs from the"
		+ "shipped one is left as it is and reported as a warning, exit 0"
	SPEC "without a git user.name or user.email, init exits 1 with a message naming the missing"
		+ "key, before creating anything"
	SPEC "it prints text and --json; the JSON document carries schema_version and one entry per"
		+ "item, the repository, the schema, the .gitignore and config.toml, each with its state:"
		+ "created, present or differs"
	AFTER @TASK.B01
	AFTER @TASK.B02
	RATIONALE "the registry, the policies, the studies, the orders and the requests are written"
		+ "into this corpus; @TASK.B04 and @TASK.B43 wait on it"
		REF @TASK.B04
		REF @TASK.B43
	RATIONALE "the template moves under the package because"
		+ "@DECISION.ShippedFilesLiveInsideThePackageAndAreReadAsResources rejects a root-level"
		+ "schema/, absent from dist/brigade.pyz; the place of the corpus, its .gitignore and"
		+ "config.toml written once at init follow"
		+ "@DECISION.PathsAndConfigurationAreResolvedInOnePlaceFromXdgVariables, which also leaves"
		+ "the state and cache directories to their writers"
		REF @DECISION.ShippedFilesLiveInsideThePackageAndAreReadAsResources
		REF @DECISION.PathsAndConfigurationAreResolvedInOnePlaceFromXdgVariables
	RATIONALE "config.toml is written, not read: the frozen record and its validation arrive with"
		+ "@TASK.B42, its first reader, whose doctor finding names brigade init when no client is"
		+ "configured"
		REF @TASK.B42
	RATIONALE "a differing file is reported, never rewritten, so that a second init stays harmless;"
		+ "upgrading an installed schema is left to a later task"
	RATIONALE "the document and the exit codes follow"
		+ "@DECISION.EveryCommandReturnsOneDocumentRenderedOnceAndExitsByOneTable"
		REF @DECISION.EveryCommandReturnsOneDocumentRenderedOnceAndExitsByOneTable
	SOURCE "the Artifact Brigade Blueprint, plan sections 13 and 16; the user's rulings of"
		+ "2026-10-05 in the refinement of B03"

TASK B04
	TITLE "brigade project add, list, show, pause and resume: the registry in the operational"
		+ "corpus"
	STATUS todo
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "registry"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "brigade project add <path> appends a PROJECT entity to projects.awawa of the operational"
		+ "corpus, named after the basename of the path with every character outside an identifier"
		+ "replaced by _, or after --name; a --name that is not an identifier exits 2"
	SPEC "it discovers PATH, absolute; REMOTE, owner/name of the origin remote; MAIN, the branch"
		+ "origin/HEAD names, else the branch checked out; CORPUS, the folder holding the tracked"
		+ ".awawa files, absent when there is none; FORGE github when the origin remote is on"
		+ "github.com; STATUS active"
	SPEC "--acceptance, --heavy and --setup, repeatable, write ACCEPTANCE, HEAVY and SETUP lines; a"
		+ "field given no flag is guessed from the supported configurations, HEAVY never"
	SPEC "a package.json at the root: the package manager is bun for a bun.lock or bun.lockb, pnpm"
		+ "for a pnpm-lock.yaml, yarn for a yarn.lock, npm otherwise; ACCEPTANCE <pm> run <script>"
		+ "for each of the scripts test, lint and typecheck it declares; SETUP npm ci with a"
		+ "package-lock.json, npm install without one, <pm> install --frozen-lockfile for bun, pnpm"
		+ "and yarn"
	SPEC "a pyproject.toml, setup.py or requirements.txt at the root, or a test_*.py under a root"
		+ "tests/ directory: ACCEPTANCE python3 -m pytest when pyproject.toml has a"
		+ "[tool.pytest.ini_options] table or a pytest.ini or conftest.py sits at the root, python3"
		+ "-m unittest otherwise; SETUP uv sync --frozen with a uv.lock, none otherwise"
	SPEC "a Cargo.toml at the root: ACCEPTANCE cargo test; SETUP cargo fetch --locked with a"
		+ "Cargo.lock, none otherwise"
	SPEC "several configurations add their lines in the order package.json, Python, Rust; the"
		+ "document marks every guessed line as guessed and says when no supported configuration"
		+ "was found"
	SPEC "a path or a name already registered exits 1 naming the PROJECT entity and writes nothing;"
		+ "--force replaces that entity"
	SPEC "brigade project list prints every project with its name, path and status; brigade project"
		+ "show <name> prints its fields; an unknown name exits 1"
	SPEC "brigade project pause <name> and resume <name> set STATUS paused and active; a project"
		+ "already in that status is left as it is, exit 0"
	SPEC "every write runs under the lock of the corpus repository in"
		+ "$XDG_STATE_HOME/brigade/locks/, then awawa fmt, awawa lint --strict and one git commit;"
		+ "a failing lint restores the corpus with git and exits 1"
	SPEC "before brigade init, every project command exits 1 with a message naming brigade init"
	SPEC "every command prints text and --json; the JSON document carries schema_version"
	AFTER @TASK.B03
	RATIONALE "the registry is the list of projects every wave, study and order points at;"
		+ "@TASK.B08, @TASK.B10 and @TASK.B38 wait on it"
		REF @TASK.B08
		REF @TASK.B10
		REF @TASK.B38
	RATIONALE "the user ruled that the commands are given by flags and guessed only when absent,"
		+ "from a short list of supported configurations, package.json, Python and Rust to begin"
		+ "with; HEAVY is never guessed, a heavy suite being a judgment"
	RATIONALE "--init-corpus left B04 for @TASK.B55: awawa's binary ships no starter, the WAVE"
		+ "schema comes with @TASK.B10, and opening the pull request needs the forge adapter of"
		+ "@TASK.B46"
		REF @TASK.B55
		REF @TASK.B10
		REF @TASK.B46
	RATIONALE "the name is turned into an identifier because awawa refuses another: PROJECT"
		+ "my-app.v2 fails lint with L017"
	RATIONALE "the lock, the rollback and the gateways follow"
		+ "@DECISION.StateIsWrittenAtomicallyUnderLocksKeptInTheStateDirectory and"
		+ "@DECISION.OneRunnerForEverySubprocessAndGatewaysForGitAndAwawa; the corpus folder"
		+ "discovered follows @DECISION.TheCorpusFolderIsDeclaredByTheProjectAndDefaultsToCorpus"
		REF @DECISION.StateIsWrittenAtomicallyUnderLocksKeptInTheStateDirectory
		REF @DECISION.OneRunnerForEverySubprocessAndGatewaysForGitAndAwawa
