		+ "schema, refuses an answer that changed a CLI-filled section, writes it to the output,"
		+ "file on a branch of the project with a pull request where the project has a forge,"
		+ "corpus entity through fmt, lint and a commit, inbox signal, forge issue or"
		+ "brigade-output-<name> on PATH"
	SPEC "the tick runs each due study under the slot cap and records order.started, step.done,"
		+ "step.failed, order.parked and order.done with kind study"
	SPEC "study list, show, pause and resume; list prints every study with its schedule, last run"
