		+ "being one of worktree, commit, pull-request and merge; a value substitutes {param} from"
		+ "the order and the project, nothing else"
	SPEC "a judge step names a slot, a procedure and a template or an answer schema; a gate step"
		+ "names a check, an executable printing ok and reason, resolved like a collector, with the"
		+ "built-ins pr-is-reviewed, checks-green, branch-descends-from and corpus-lint-green;"
		+ "on_fail is park by default, else skip, stop or retry:N"
	SPEC "recipes resolve in order: the project's .brigade/recipes/, the machine's recipes"
		+ "directory, brigade's recipes/; brigade recipes list prints them with their source, wave"
		+ "listed as native, and brigade recipes show <name> prints the file"
	SPEC "brigade recipe lint checks the schema, that every collector, check, output, procedure and"
		+ "slot resolves, that every param referenced is declared, and refuses a client or model"
		+ "key and a command naming the configured client's binary"
	SPEC "recipes/study.toml ships as the built-in recipe study, its collect steps taken from the"
		+ "order's COLLECTOR lines"
